('washdown-system','Industrial Washdown System','Reference facility sanitation/washdown equipment category.','equipment','new_products','washdown','Sanitation'),
('security-cameras','Commercial Security Camera System','Reference physical security technology category.','equipment','new_products','video_security','Security'),
